    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Sleeping Arrangements<br>Two Story Home | Guest, Queen Bed; Guest, King Bed; Guest, King Bed; Master, King Bed; Living, Queen Sleeper Sofa; Landing, Twin Sleeper Sofa<br><br>Parking: This property provides two driveway parking spots, offering guests direct access to the unit.<br><br>Escape to the charm of Miramar Beach, Florida, and experience the coastal elegance of Villa Lago 1864. This Mediterranean-inspired pet friendly home offers the perfect blend of luxury and convenience. Inside, you’ll find a beautifully appointed, fully equipped kitchen featuring stainless steel appliances, updated cabinetry, and stunning granite countertops. Whether you're preparing a family feast or a quick snack, the spacious kitchen offers plenty of room to create your culinary masterpiece. Afterward, gather around the large dining table to share delicious meals and fond memories while reliving the day's adventures.<br><br>The four bedrooms exude the peaceful vibe of the beach, with soothing neutral tones reflecting the natural beauty of Miramar Beach. Each room is designed for relaxation, featuring comfortable, oversized beds with large windows that frame picturesque views of the landscape. One bedroom is a playful retreat for younger guests, with a bunk bed. All bedrooms are conveniently connected to their own en suite bathroom, where you'll find luxurious granite countertops, walk-in showers, and a oversized tub in the master bath, and stylish fixtures that make each bathroom feel like a spa.<br><br>For extra fun and convenience, Villa Lago 1864 includes two golf carts – a 6-seat and a 4-seat – ready to take you and your group around the resort in comfort and style. Cruise over to the Village of Baytowne Wharf for lively entertainment or visit Grand Boulevard for shopping, dining, and events – your adventure awaits just around the corner.<br><br>The home is situated on the golf course, with stunning views surrounding you. Relax and enjoy the scenery from the back patio, which is easily accessible, or head up to the second-floor balcony to watch the action on the greens. The Villa Lago community pool is just a short stroll away, offering the perfect spot to cool off and unwind.<br><br>Whether you’re here to relax, explore, or enjoy all that Miramar Beach has to offer, Villa Lago 1864 is your perfect home away from home.<br><br>Guest Walk-Through <br>Two Story Unit – Kitchen, Living Room, Dining Room, 4 Bedrooms, 4 Bathrooms<br><br>Unit Amenities- 2 Golf Carts, Driveway Parking for 2 Cars<br>Community Amenities- Community Pool<br>Resort Amenities- Gated Community, Multiple Pools, Resort Tram, Fitness Center/Spa/Salon, Golf, Tennis, Marina, Shops, Restaurants, Entertainment, Private Beach, Watersports<br><br>About the Community of Villa Lago<br>Villa Lago is the latest addition to the SANDESTIN GOLF AND BEACH RESORT® offering single family 3-, 4- and 5-bedroom homes with Mediterranean-style and resort comforts. Enjoy amenities such as the community pool and the first class dining and entertainment options of the Village of Baytowne Wharf. Most properties have either a lake or golf course view. Rent with us today and discover what a truly relaxing and carefree vacation feels like at Villa Lago. Amenities such as golf, tennis, biking, boating, water sports and more are available locally at additional costs.<br><br>Local Favorites<br>MVH guests receive savings with our Local Favorites. Enjoy discounts to restaurants, beach activities, and shopping so you can save while you stay.<br><br>MVH Beach Closet<br>This property offers a Beach Closet stocked with complimentary beach chairs and an umbrella for use during your stay.<br><br>MVH Rental Restrictions<br>Please reference the Rental Restrictions and Terms of Use.<br><br>Pet Friendly Unit <br>Pets are welcome here! Please note it is an additional $250 for one pet, $350 for two pets, plus taxes and admin fee.<br><br>SANDESTIN® is a federally registered trademark owned by Sandestin Investments, LLC (“SI”). My Vacation Haven, LLC is an independent entity and is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or associated with SI. Any use or reference to SI or its trademarks is solely to identify a property and not to suggest any affiliation with SI.",
